	(text "High beam, turn signals and illumination are active at +12 V: 4.7 kΩ → EL817 LED → ground.\nNeutral is active to ground (the gearbox switch grounds the wire):\n+12V_P → 3.3 kΩ → LED → neutral wire. Outputs active low with the Pico's internal pull-up.\nWire colors and neutral logic [TO VERIFY] with the bike measurements."
